---
import Header  from "@components/Header.astro";
import BaseHead from "@components/BaseHead.astro";
import {Font, Image} from 'astro:assets';
import hongkongphooey from '../assets/images/hongkongphooey.jpg';
import '@styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
	<BaseHead title="About" description="About Me"/>
	</head>
	<Header/>
	<body>
	<div>
		<div class="card">
		<div class="centerimg">
		<Image src={hongkongphooey} alt="role model" width=500% class=thumbnail />
		</div>
		<h1> Welcome </h1>
		Welcome to my blog, I'll write things here about whatever interests me. I felt like I've been lagging behind a couple of
		friends who have already been blogging for a long time, so now, <a href="">2026 years after Jesus' birth</a>, I will start my blog.
		<br>
		<br>
		Check out my friends' blogs.
		<br>
		Punpun: <a href="https://punx2.vercel.app/">https://punx2.vercel.app/</a>
		<br>
		Aayush: <a href="https://aayushkarki.com/">https://aayushkarki.com/</a>
		<br>
		Oscar:  <a href="https://baleinegris.github.io/blog/">https://baleinegris.github.io/blog/</a>
		<br>
		Harry: <a href="https://mvp-harry.github.io/">https://mvp-harry.github.io/</a>
		<br>
		<br>
		You can also check out my website: <a href="https://jamdays.github.io/">https://jamdays.github.io/</a>
		<br>
		<br>
		Also, I know the light mode toggle doesn't work, don't be mad, not everything is perfect. If you are upset, try radical acceptance (this helps according to my girlfriend).
		<br>
		<br>
		<hr>
		<h1> About Me </h1>
		My name is Max. I'm interested in plenty of things. You can review the picture above for more context.	
		<br>
		<br>
		Anyway, you should treat this more like two truths and a lie, because I'm 
		gonna put some fake information (so no one can build a psychological profile of me,
		and then manipulate me into revealing personal details on the internet). 
		<br>
		<br>
		Ok, now, here are some personal details about me.
		I grew up in Portland, OR, USA. Growing up, I mostly read books and played games on my tablet,
		but I also had to go to mass and school. My role model is hong kong phooey because he is quite smart and solves mysteries.	
		<br>
		<br>
		Really, that should be enough to understand who I am to the extent you have to. Otherwise, if you want to know more about
		me you can just read my blog. In case some are worried, there will also be a similar amount of pictures, in general, to accommodate the visually minded.
		<br>
		<br>
		<hr>
		<h1> More </h1>
		Here's how to contact me
		<ul>
			<li>Email: <a href="mailto:mdjaya@protonmail.com">mdjaya@protonmail.com</a> </li>
		</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
	</body>
</html>
<style>
	.thumbnail {
		border-radius: 100%;
		margin: auto;
	}
	.centerimg {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
	}
</style>
